\begin{lemma} \label{lem33} 
For a set of normal matrices which are also in the class $\mathbb{F} = \{A : a_{ij} \ge 0 \,\,for \,\,all \,\, i \ne j \}$, D-stability, individual Volterra-Lyapunoc stability, and simultaneous Volterra-Lyapunoc stability are all equivalent to stability. 
\end{lemma}

